@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### Paste JWTs from IdentityService (/api/auth/login) below
@customerAccessToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@staffAccessToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPPORT_OR_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Paste IDs returned from 1.1 (Create Shipment) and subsequent calls
@shipmentId = REPLACE_WITH_SHIPMENT_ID
@trackingNumber = REPLACE_WITH_TRACKING_NUMBER
@instructionId = REPLACE_WITH_INSTRUCTION_ID
@rescheduleId = REPLACE_WITH_RESCHEDULE_ID
@returnId = REPLACE_WITH_RETURN_ID

# ==============================================================================
# 1. SHIPMENTS (/api/shipments)
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Create a Shipment (Customer)
# @name createShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Alice Johnson",
  "recipientPhone": "+15550101001",
  "addressLine1": "742 Evergreen Terrace",
  "addressLine2": "Apt 4B",
  "city": "Springfield",
  "state": "IL",
  "postalCode": "62704",
  "country": "USA",
  "latitude": 39.7817,
  "longitude": -89.6501,
  "expectedDeliveryDate": "2026-12-05T18:00:00Z",
  "initialInstructions": [
    {
      "instructionType": "DeliveryLocation",
      "dropOffPlace": "Front porch",
      "gateOrAccessCode": "4421#",
      "floor": "2",
      "door": "4B",
      "instructionText": "Please leave behind the planter if no one answers.",
      "photoUrl": "https://example.com/instructions/porch.jpg"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 1.2 List Shipments (Customer sees own; Staff/Driver sees all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 1.3 Get Shipment Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 1.4 Update Shipment Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientPhone": "+15550109999",
  "addressLine2": "Apt 4C"
}

###

### 1.5 Public Tracking Lookup (No Auth Required, Non-PII)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/track/{{trackingNumber}}

###

### 1.6 Get Shipment Status History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 1.7 Record Tracking Update (SupportAgent or Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit",
  "note": "Arrived at regional sorting facility.",
  "location": "Chicago, IL"
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# 2. DELIVERY INSTRUCTIONS (/api/shipments/{shipmentId}/instructions)
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Create Delivery Instruction (Idempotent)
# @name createInstruction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/instructions
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: instr-create-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructionType": "DeliveryLocation",
  "dropOffPlace": "Mailroom",
  "gateOrAccessCode": "1234*",
  "floor": "1",
  "door": "Mailroom A",
  "instructionText": "Ring bell #102 on arrival.",
  "photoUrl": "https://example.com/instructions/mailroom.jpg"
}

###

### 2.2 Replay Same Create Instruction Request (Expected: same 201 response, no duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/instructions
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: instr-create-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructionType": "DeliveryLocation",
  "dropOffPlace": "Mailroom",
  "gateOrAccessCode": "1234*",
  "floor": "1",
  "door": "Mailroom A",
  "instructionText": "Ring bell #102 on arrival.",
  "photoUrl": "https://example.com/instructions/mailroom.jpg"
}

###

### 2.3 List Instructions for Shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/instructions
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 2.4 Update Delivery Instruction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/instructions/{{instructionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: instr-update-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dropOffPlace": "Reception desk",
  "gateOrAccessCode": "9876#",
  "instructionText": "Hand over to concierge if unavailable."
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# 3. RESCHEDULES (/api/shipments/{shipmentId}/reschedules)
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Request Reschedule (Customer)
# @name createReschedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/reschedules
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: resched-create-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedDeliveryDate": "2026-12-10T15:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Will be away on original delivery date."
}

###

### 3.2 List Reschedule Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/reschedules
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 3.3 Process Reschedule Request (SupportAgent or Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/reschedules/{{rescheduleId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: resched-process-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approve",
  "reason": "Confirmed with carrier window."
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# 4. RETURNS (/api/shipments/{shipmentId}/returns)
# ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Initiate Return (Customer)
# @name initiateReturn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: return-init-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnReason": "No longer needed."
}

###

### 4.2 List Returns for Shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

###

### 4.3 Update Return Status (SupportAgent or Administrator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/returns/{{returnId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ReturnedToSender"
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# 5. NEGATIVE / AUTH CHECKS
# ==============================================================================

### 5.1 List Shipments Without Token (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments

###

### 5.2 Track Non-Existent Shipment (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/track/NONEXISTENT
